WEBVTT

00:03.540 --> 00:05.080
<b>This girl...
Isn't she Nonoka Tachibana from the Sundolls?</b>

00:03.750 --> 00:05.790
Her hair's dyed blonde...

00:06.380 --> 00:08.040
...but it's Nonoka Tachibana?

00:14.580 --> 00:17.540
Ahh, I love air conditioning.

00:15.880 --> 00:20.880
<b>Episode 8:   Covert Gig</b>

00:17.830 --> 00:21.460
When it's this hot it's hard to get
motivated to do anything, isn't it?

00:21.460 --> 00:22.580
Right?

00:22.880 --> 00:27.380
Hey, you're all slacking off too much!
We've gotta get ready for what's coming in two months!

00:27.750 --> 00:28.790
Oh, right.

00:29.130 --> 00:31.330
The group became official on Halloween, didn't it?

00:31.540 --> 00:34.670
So I want to put on a live gig to commemorate!

00:35.080 --> 00:37.920
Okay, but how are we going to do that?

00:38.330 --> 00:39.960
We can't really show out faces.

00:40.420 --> 00:42.170
Especially not me or Kano.

00:42.170 --> 00:45.080
I knew you might say that!

00:45.170 --> 00:46.540
<b>JELEE First Anniversary</b>

00:45.170 --> 00:46.540
<b>Commemorative Gig!!</b>

00:46.960 --> 00:49.210
I see, we can use masks!

00:49.210 --> 00:50.380
That's right!

00:50.750 --> 00:54.460
We'll hide our faces with masks and perform in costume!

00:54.460 --> 00:56.880
That's the answer to JELEE's live gig right there!

00:57.210 --> 01:01.420
So we hold the gig keeping JELEE as a group of
anonymous artists?

01:01.420 --> 01:02.710
Exactly!

01:02.710 --> 01:03.790
I love it!

01:04.000 --> 01:08.920
Besides, we haven't had the chance to deliver
a live gig to people yet, you know?

01:09.170 --> 01:12.500
Huh? But we just did the other day at Ms. Shizue's gig.

01:12.500 --> 01:15.750
But none of our fans were there.

01:17.040 --> 01:18.750
I want to get it to them directly.

01:19.080 --> 01:20.420
To perform our songs,

01:20.420 --> 01:22.170
for our fans!

01:24.210 --> 01:29.130
Mahou wa itsukara tsukaeru yoni narunoka

01:29.250 --> 01:34.000
Tokubetsu na nanika ni zutto akogareteta

01:34.290 --> 01:39.170
1 2 3 de maenarae B C D iiko ni suru no wa

01:39.290 --> 01:44.790
Watashi janai tte watashi ga ichiban shitteirunda

01:45.670 --> 01:51.380
Konomama de ii nante dare mo omocchanai yo

01:51.380 --> 01:54.170
Aseru ryouashi ga omoi no

01:55.170 --> 01:58.830
Konna ni chikaku ni iru kimi ni sae

01:58.960 --> 02:03.540
Modokashii hodo todokanai noni kono me ga utsushita

02:03.790 --> 02:09.420
Irotoridori yoridori midori no mei

02:09.420 --> 02:14.420
Nando datte mou iyannatatte kimi to kyoumei

02:14.630 --> 02:19.380
Loop shisou na shikou o yabutte

02:19.380 --> 02:24.000
Yuutsu na hibi ni mayday watashi wa chuu o matte

02:24.000 --> 02:28.710
Kumorizora no fuchi ni kaburitsuki

02:28.880 --> 02:36.670
Nomikomu nigai suppai shoppai igai ni amai no kamoshirenai na

02:39.000 --> 02:45.750
Hikari no sashikomu hou e ikunda

02:52.960 --> 02:55.130
<b>One week later...</b>

02:56.670 --> 03:01.460
Oh hey, by the way. There's a big announcement
coming from JELEE soon.

03:01.460 --> 03:06.170
<b>Big
Announcement</b>

03:01.710 --> 03:02.630
So yeah...

03:02.630 --> 03:04.040
Rescue the world for us!

03:04.040 --> 03:05.380
Are you getting married to a non-celebrity?

03:05.380 --> 03:06.210
...actually...

03:07.080 --> 03:11.040
And as long as we're gonna do a live gig, we wanna
reveal a new song there, right?!

03:11.460 --> 03:12.500
R-right.

03:12.500 --> 03:13.920
Don't we?!

03:13.920 --> 03:14.580
Yes!

03:14.960 --> 03:16.830
Well, yeah. Sure.

03:17.210 --> 03:21.460
And then there's so much to think about,
like the venue and stage design,

03:21.790 --> 03:25.250
so I want to do a brainstorming getaway where
we stay over and really talk this through!

03:25.420 --> 03:29.210
S-s-stay over?! A sleepover with me and Nono-tan?!

03:29.630 --> 03:31.710
With all of us, okay?

03:32.000 --> 03:34.540
Hmm... A sleepover, huh?

03:35.000 --> 03:36.460
Oh, would that not work?

03:36.460 --> 03:38.330
For your channel and stuff?

03:38.330 --> 03:40.540
Nah, only because I hate going out.

03:40.540 --> 03:41.790
You're way too honest.

03:42.210 --> 03:44.040
Then what shall we do?

03:44.380 --> 03:45.630
Hmm...

03:45.920 --> 03:47.540
Oh! Then how's this?

03:47.880 --> 03:51.210
What if we get an app so Kiui can participate remotely?

03:52.380 --> 03:55.920
True. We can use a tablet to connect via video.

03:56.250 --> 03:57.920
We'll be together even when we're apart!

04:00.250 --> 04:04.880
So I can't tell you the details yet,
but we'll make an announcement soon!

04:05.960 --> 04:07.710
<b>What? I can't wait!
Don't tease us
Come on!
Tell us, Nox!</b>

04:08.210 --> 04:10.330
Well then, goodbye world!

04:10.960 --> 04:12.460
<b>This live stream has ended</b>

04:16.000 --> 04:19.630
A sleepover with everyone's not really my style, but...

04:28.540 --> 04:29.500
Hano?

04:30.750 --> 04:33.630
Mahiru? So the getaway's starting tomorrow, right?

04:33.630 --> 04:35.460
I'm just so excited.

04:35.710 --> 04:36.750
Thath ahll?

04:36.750 --> 04:37.420
Yeah!

04:37.710 --> 04:41.290
Ith ithn't like you, callin juth to chat.

04:42.420 --> 04:44.210
Now that you mention it, this might be a first.

04:44.630 --> 04:47.170
But I suddenly just wanted to hear your voice.

04:48.040 --> 04:51.040
Hey, aren'th you embarrathed at all sayin shtuff like that?

04:51.210 --> 04:54.380
But for all you say you humor me anyway, Mahiru.

04:54.500 --> 04:57.420
Uh, wha? Are you takin afvantage ob me?

04:57.420 --> 05:00.130
Yep! You're Japanese and incapable of saying no!

05:00.130 --> 05:01.500
Ohay, gonna hang uff now.

05:01.500 --> 05:04.500
Hey, I'm joking! My bad!

05:04.500 --> 05:07.580
Kano! The bath is all yours now!

05:07.580 --> 05:08.880
Oh. Okay!

05:09.170 --> 05:11.710
And hey, isn't your getaway starting tomorrow?

05:11.710 --> 05:12.830
Are you all packed?

05:12.830 --> 05:15.210
You'd better get prepared or you'll forget something for sure-

05:14.000 --> 05:15.790
Glad I got to hear your voice!

05:15.210 --> 05:16.790
<b>Kano Yamanouchi
In Call</b>

05:15.790 --> 05:16.920
Anyway, goodnight!

05:16.830 --> 05:18.670
<b>Call Ended</b>

05:19.250 --> 05:21.790
Honeftly, she's such a free spirith.

05:26.630 --> 05:28.420
<b>Universal Hotel</b>

05:26.630 --> 05:28.420
<b>Book This Room</b>

05:26.830 --> 05:28.460
None of these are great.

05:28.880 --> 05:30.710
So to give an overview of what everyone wants...

05:30.710 --> 05:31.380
Yes?

05:31.880 --> 05:38.000
The hotel should have: WiFi, space for
four people to work, with spacious beds.

05:38.000 --> 05:39.880
Got that? Those three criteria!

05:38.330 --> 05:40.290
<b>hotel romantic stay with loved one wedding night</b>

05:39.080 --> 05:40.290
<b>Search</b>

05:40.420 --> 05:45.580
Got it! Leave it to me. Mei Kim Anouk Takanashi
will get the job done!

05:45.580 --> 05:49.750
<b>Playing a recording on loop</b>

05:46.000 --> 05:47.790
Did you get all that? You'll be okay?

05:48.040 --> 05:49.670
Yes! It's all okay!

05:50.130 --> 05:53.380
Accommodation for my first getaway
with Nono-tan has to be worthy.

05:53.380 --> 05:56.330
Much more beautiful, enchanted, and cute!

05:56.580 --> 05:58.920
<b>4 night 6 day trip to Paris, France
for two</b>

05:56.580 --> 05:58.920
<b>Best for couples!</b>

05:56.590 --> 05:58.920
<b>One party of two</b>

05:56.790 --> 05:57.880
Then maybe this is it!

05:59.170 --> 06:01.500
Ahh! No, that's not it!

06:05.170 --> 06:06.130
This is the place!

06:06.710 --> 06:08.670
<b>Omiya Station</b>

06:07.460 --> 06:11.210
I was wondering what accommodation Mei booked,

06:11.580 --> 06:13.830
but this is totally where we used to live.

06:13.830 --> 06:14.500
Yeah.

06:15.170 --> 06:16.080
What's wrong?

06:16.540 --> 06:20.290
Oh, well... I think I might run
into someone I know here.

06:20.290 --> 06:22.830
Hello everyone! Are you all ready to go?

06:23.630 --> 06:25.710
Then allow me to lead the way!

06:29.130 --> 06:31.040
I can't wait to see where we're staying.

06:31.040 --> 06:32.250
Yeah!

06:33.630 --> 06:35.750
Uh, where are we headed?

06:36.130 --> 06:37.790
<b>Weekday rest stay:
Weekday night stay:</b>

06:36.540 --> 06:37.630
I dunno...

06:37.630 --> 06:39.250
I'm getting worried.

06:40.000 --> 06:40.920
We're here!

06:44.670 --> 06:45.500
Look.

06:46.460 --> 06:47.460
This is it!

06:51.040 --> 06:52.830
This is a place for couples to…

06:53.960 --> 06:56.750
N-no! That's wasn't my intention at all!

06:55.920 --> 06:57.540
We know, we know.

06:56.750 --> 07:00.000
Wow! I've never been to this kind of place before!

07:00.000 --> 07:04.580
Well, if a former idol and high school girl had
been to one before, that would be a problem.

07:08.170 --> 07:09.670
Huh...

07:10.960 --> 07:12.500
Let's see...

07:12.830 --> 07:14.130
This room, maybe?

07:13.670 --> 07:15.920
<b>Thank you!</b>

07:14.790 --> 07:15.710
There we go.

07:16.330 --> 07:17.830
Where's reception?

07:18.330 --> 07:20.880
Don't tell me you've been to
one of these before, Mahiru?

07:20.880 --> 07:21.380
Huh?

07:23.460 --> 07:26.250
Same as everyone else. It's my first time.

07:26.250 --> 07:27.290
Actually?

07:26.580 --> 07:27.290
Sounds suspicious!

07:27.540 --> 07:28.500
<b>Feel free to
take amenities</b>

07:36.210 --> 07:38.630
Oooh!

07:39.790 --> 07:41.540
This is such a nice room!

07:41.540 --> 07:42.960
It's amazing, Mei!

07:43.290 --> 07:45.670
A-are you pleased with it?

07:46.000 --> 07:48.040
What a huge bed!

07:48.040 --> 07:49.920
Lots of space in the bath, too!

07:50.750 --> 07:53.790
Great. The WiFi speed is nice and fast.

07:50.830 --> 07:51.250
<b>Your internet speed is:</b>

07:53.790 --> 07:55.540
You have a different mindset from the rest of us.

07:57.210 --> 08:02.500
The purpose of a live gig is to provide guests with
an extraordinary experience that's like a dream!

08:02.790 --> 08:04.380
That's why the costumes...

08:04.880 --> 08:06.290
...are super important!

08:06.630 --> 08:07.960
Not that one, though.

08:09.790 --> 08:10.710
Mei!

08:11.960 --> 08:13.500
You just wanted to wear it, didn't you?

08:13.830 --> 08:15.630
But this would be...

08:17.130 --> 08:18.670
...just me in cosplay.

08:20.210 --> 08:23.580
But dressing up exactly like
Little JELEE here isn't quite it.

08:23.830 --> 08:26.540
Well, that'd be cosplay too, in a way.

08:28.670 --> 08:30.330
Hey, what about that painting?!

08:30.540 --> 08:31.460
Which painting?

08:32.250 --> 08:33.630
The jellyfish from the mural!

08:33.630 --> 08:35.630
The thing that brought us together!

08:35.960 --> 08:36.880
The one in Shibuya?

08:37.460 --> 08:41.580
Yeah! What if we print an updated version of that on
our costumes?!

08:41.880 --> 08:44.580
Oh, yeah. That actually sounds doable.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.330
Sounds pretty good.

08:48.380 --> 08:49.420
Amazing!

08:50.420 --> 08:51.460
<b>Shibuya</b>

08:50.580 --> 08:55.580
So anyway, I think we should go check out
and choose from these three venues.

08:53.080 --> 08:57.040
<b>Big, clean backstage room!!
Might be way beyond our budget</b>

08:55.960 --> 09:00.420
We can decide on the setlist to match the
crowd's energy levels. What do you think?

09:01.500 --> 09:04.000
Actually, I'm amazed.

09:04.380 --> 09:08.630
It's such a solid plan. I have trouble
believing you came up with it, Kano.

09:08.630 --> 09:10.130
You had no faith in me?!

09:10.670 --> 09:17.080
Anyway, you know how in the last year,
we've racked up an amazing number of supporters?

09:11.330 --> 09:17.040
<b>We're JELEE
We want to make a jellyfish aquarium in Shibuya</b>

09:11.340 --> 09:17.040
<b>Followers
Following  </b>

09:18.040 --> 09:22.000
That's why I want to make this gig something
we create with all our fans!

09:22.540 --> 09:23.670
With our fans?

09:23.920 --> 09:26.080
It's a really beautiful sight.

09:27.210 --> 09:30.750
Everyone waves glowsticks in the same color, all at once.

09:31.540 --> 09:38.630
Then in the darkness, my favorite color blue is the only
thing floating there, waving gently in time with the music.

09:39.250 --> 09:40.710
But then, I notice.

09:41.210 --> 09:46.170
Some of the lights are a little late, and some of them
aren't going in the same direction.

09:46.750 --> 09:50.460
And that reminds me, that those aren't just lights.

09:50.670 --> 09:54.330
Every one of them is a fan who likes me.

09:54.830 --> 10:01.460
That's why I want to feel that! That moment of
becoming one with the fans, with all of you!

10:05.830 --> 10:06.500
Sure!

10:07.080 --> 10:14.040
<b>[LIVE] JELEE's Big Announcement</b>

10:11.080 --> 10:16.000
Today, we have a big announcement
to make to everyone listening in.

10:16.880 --> 10:22.710
On October 31, JELEE will have
a first anniversary in-person live gig!

10:23.290 --> 10:23.920
<b>Will you come to Osaka too?</b>

10:23.750 --> 10:27.420
I promise it'll be fun, so please come and see us!

10:23.960 --> 10:24.290
<b>Will you come to Osaka too?
Definitely going!!!!</b>

10:24.630 --> 10:25.290
<b>Lily:  So JELEE exists for real...</b>

10:25.330 --> 10:25.790
<b>Lily:  So JELEE exists for real...
Luna: Will the others sing, too?</b>

10:25.920 --> 10:28.040
<b>Will we get to see your face!?</b>

10:28.420 --> 10:30.290
Of course we won't be revealing our faces.

10:30.290 --> 10:33.130
That's why it's a Halloween gig
where we'll be in costume.

10:33.670 --> 10:36.710
I might be trying my hand at something new.

10:37.040 --> 10:38.710
I-I definitely won't be singing!

10:39.250 --> 10:43.130
So anyway, you have a request
for everyone, right Little JELEE?

10:43.580 --> 10:47.750
Yeah. I have a vision I want to create with everyone there.

10:48.170 --> 10:51.630
That's why I want you all to bring blue glowsticks!

10:50.960 --> 10:52.580
<b>Sure thing!
Excited
OK
Got it!
Meow
What's this?</b>

10:50.960 --> 10:52.580
<b>Blue, got it</b>

10:50.970 --> 10:52.580
<b>What are we doing?
glowsticks
blue glowsticks</b>

11:20.750 --> 11:21.960
Whew...

11:22.790 --> 11:24.420
Good work, everyone.

11:24.420 --> 11:26.380
We check out tomorrow, right?

11:26.380 --> 11:30.130
Yeah. There's still so much we have to get done, though.

11:30.420 --> 11:33.040
Let's give it our all until the day of the gig!

11:33.540 --> 11:34.920
Yeah!

11:38.750 --> 11:40.920
And now it starts raining.

11:41.290 --> 11:43.920
Well, that's pretty typical for us, isn't it?

11:43.920 --> 11:44.920
It is.

11:47.920 --> 11:50.630
Woo! It's mother nature's shower!

11:50.830 --> 11:52.000
Nono-tan!

11:52.000 --> 11:53.920
What is that girl doing?

11:54.210 --> 11:55.790
What do you mean?!

11:55.790 --> 11:57.500
A setback is an opportunity!

11:57.750 --> 11:59.540
Whoa! That's cold!

12:00.130 --> 12:01.420
This feels so good!

12:03.710 --> 12:05.170
I-I'm joining in!

12:05.170 --> 12:06.710
Jeez, this is just silly-

12:05.420 --> 12:06.420
Wow!

12:06.710 --> 12:07.130
Come on!

12:07.130 --> 12:07.670
Whoa?!

12:21.750 --> 12:22.710
I'm soaked.

12:23.250 --> 12:24.540
Hey, Mahiru?

12:25.040 --> 12:25.920
Hmm?

12:25.630 --> 12:26.880
I'm out of clothes to wear.

12:27.130 --> 12:27.960
I've...

12:27.330 --> 12:28.210
I'm completely drenched!

12:28.790 --> 12:30.080
...got a great idea!

12:31.920 --> 12:33.670
I have an additional request for everyone!

12:34.040 --> 12:36.790
On the day of the gig, in addition to the glowstick,

12:37.210 --> 12:39.330
can you bring a blue umbrella as well?!

12:39.920 --> 12:41.710
And about the venue...

12:45.330 --> 12:47.880
I guess we should say, "We're back"?

12:48.630 --> 12:51.250
The other ones were out of our budget.

12:51.630 --> 12:54.250
Well, this was the realistic choice.

12:54.710 --> 12:59.380
But even the Sundolls started off
at a much smaller venue than this.

13:01.170 --> 13:04.170
So this is the first step for us.

13:04.790 --> 13:08.670
Our first stage, where JELEE
will start swimming in real life.

13:09.960 --> 13:14.000
Excuse me! Can I get you to turn off
the lights for a moment?

13:14.790 --> 13:15.670
Whoa?!

13:20.170 --> 13:26.000
Just like this, everyone will light the place up,
and the venue will be filled with light!

13:26.250 --> 13:27.630
Doesn't that sound awesome?

13:30.040 --> 13:32.040
I so want to see that now!

13:32.040 --> 13:33.960
Yes, I can't wait!

13:34.630 --> 13:35.420
Right?

13:37.290 --> 13:38.130
Kano!

13:40.290 --> 13:41.290
What's up?

13:41.670 --> 13:42.500
Look!

13:43.290 --> 13:50.670
<b>YTuber exposes the truth!</b>

13:43.710 --> 13:46.750
"Former idol who retired due to incident of assault..."

13:46.750 --> 13:50.540
"...making music again anonymously
in a group of four high school girls?!"

13:51.960 --> 13:52.710
Huh?

13:56.960 --> 13:59.920
<b>Hi Horebore, please excuse me for DMing out of the blue!
You know that violent idol Nonoka Tachibana you featured
on your stream like, three years ago?
She supposedly retired after that, but some pop idol fandoms
are rumoring that the vocalist for a group called JELEE
might actually be Nonoka Tachibana.
I'm sending you some evidence floating around online,</b>

13:56.970 --> 13:59.920
<b>so could you take a look and tell me what you think?
(I actually took some of the photos!)</b>

13:57.330 --> 13:59.670
Honestly, I was shocked.

14:00.000 --> 14:06.460
So apparently that violent idol Nonoka Tachibana
started performing in secret again!

14:06.830 --> 14:10.460
A photo from a live gig shows
she definitely has moles in the same spot.

14:10.670 --> 14:14.960
She didn't officially appear as JELEE
at the gig so it's not totally confirmed,

14:14.960 --> 14:16.790
but I mean... come on, people.

14:17.210 --> 14:20.670
Given the evidence, I'd say it's 90% incriminating.

14:23.750 --> 14:25.710
<b>Former idol who retired due to incident of assault was making
anonymous music in group of four high school girls?!</b>

14:24.330 --> 14:25.750
What's up with this?

14:26.460 --> 14:28.880
Sorry. This is my fault.

14:29.130 --> 14:31.080
N-no it's not!

14:31.080 --> 14:31.540
<b>Celebrity Topics</b>

14:31.080 --> 14:31.540
<b>Violence instigator Nonoka secretly</b>

14:31.090 --> 14:31.540
<b>back in "show biz" lmao</b>

14:31.580 --> 14:32.670
<b>Violence instigator Nonoka was secretly
back in "show biz" lmao</b>

14:31.630 --> 14:34.130
We never planned to perform at that gig.

14:34.540 --> 14:35.750
No, I mean...

14:36.250 --> 14:38.210
this is because of my past.

14:38.630 --> 14:39.630
Kano...

14:39.540 --> 14:43.080
<b>Kun
If she atoned for her sins and started afresh that might
be understandable, but she offers no explanation and doesn't
even show her face... That's proof she has something to hide</b>

14:40.210 --> 14:44.920
If I was just a normal anonymous artist,
this wouldn't have happened.

14:41.380 --> 14:44.040
<b>Menta
Ultimately, the kind of people who have the nerve to instigate
violence and then keep on singing as if they didn't do anything
wrong get their way, I guess. Being young is no excuse.</b>

14:42.330 --> 14:46.130
<b>Waiting on fanservice
Uh, who?</b>

14:45.790 --> 14:51.920
Anyway, if we wait until this dies down,
we'll be okay. I think.

14:49.130 --> 14:52.330
<b>We're JELEE
We want to make a jellyfish aquarium in Shibuya
Followers
Following</b>

14:52.830 --> 14:54.460
We have to cancel the gig?!

14:54.750 --> 14:56.250
I'm really sorry.

14:56.960 --> 15:01.750
We received quite a number of messages.
Some of the wording were basically threats.

15:02.250 --> 15:04.460
But we worked so hard for the day!

15:04.830 --> 15:07.420
Mei, sorry. It's okay.

15:07.420 --> 15:08.170
Huh?

15:08.750 --> 15:11.540
This all started because I dragged everyone into it.

15:12.040 --> 15:15.170
I can't cause any more trouble for you all.

15:15.880 --> 15:17.170
You're wrong.

15:17.170 --> 15:17.880
Huh?

15:18.540 --> 15:20.500
Maybe that was true at the start.

15:20.880 --> 15:25.420
You'd come up with a crazy idea and
we'd say "jeez" and follow along.

15:26.130 --> 15:29.130
But hey. Do you really think that's all this is?

15:30.710 --> 15:35.880
Because you know, I'm already invested
in seeing that beautiful sight you saw!

15:37.880 --> 15:40.920
So this gig isn't about you dragging us into it.

15:41.250 --> 15:44.500
This is something all four of us want to do, as JELEE!

15:45.920 --> 15:47.920
I'm begging you, please let us do this!

15:48.580 --> 15:49.380
Mei.

15:50.500 --> 15:51.630
Please!

15:52.830 --> 15:54.830
Kiui. Mahiru.

15:54.830 --> 15:56.880
Hmm, I still don't know...

15:57.500 --> 15:58.170
Please.

15:58.670 --> 15:59.750
Please let us do this!

16:00.330 --> 16:04.460
Pleading won't help!
What would you do if we incur damage?

16:04.460 --> 16:07.170
High schoolers can't take responsibility for that!

16:07.170 --> 16:08.040
Well...

16:08.460 --> 16:09.380
If that's the issue,

16:10.210 --> 16:11.130
I'll compensate you!

16:11.130 --> 16:12.500
Uh, hey!

16:12.500 --> 16:13.880
My idol's dream...

16:14.880 --> 16:16.330
is my dream!

16:17.960 --> 16:18.830
Okay...

16:20.670 --> 16:23.290
What if... we have no audience?

16:23.710 --> 16:24.920
No audience?

16:25.750 --> 16:29.040
That way at least, there'll be no issues of violence.

16:29.500 --> 16:32.130
But then our fans won't be able to-

16:32.130 --> 16:33.420
We can still connect with them.

16:33.790 --> 16:36.380
People can form connections, even across a screen.

16:36.830 --> 16:39.080
At least that's what I've always done.

16:39.540 --> 16:42.790
So yeah, won't you trust me on this one?

16:43.580 --> 16:44.580
Kiui...

16:46.670 --> 16:48.630
<b>Two months later...</b>

16:49.290 --> 16:52.380
Well, I'm glad we managed to put on the gig somehow.

16:49.920 --> 16:51.880
<b>The gig will be starting shortly.</b>

16:53.130 --> 16:54.130
Kano.

16:54.500 --> 16:55.170
Hmm?

16:55.920 --> 16:57.830
Sure you're not pretending to be okay?

16:58.130 --> 16:59.000
Nono-tan...

16:59.500 --> 17:00.250
Kano.

17:01.080 --> 17:07.380
See, when I started JELEE,
all I wanted was to get back at everyone.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.420
<b>The gig will be starting shortly.</b>

17:07.580 --> 17:11.960
But now, I've found a proper reason to sing.

17:13.210 --> 17:15.920
So I'm okay now, no matter what!

17:16.080 --> 17:16.960
<b>You couldn't handle an actual in-person gig lol
Nono-tan lmao</b>

17:16.090 --> 17:16.960
<b>#Nono-tan #violentIdol #JELEE</b>

17:16.380 --> 17:17.380
<b>The Knights Hasabada
A live stream... I guess  that's okay?
At least no one will get punched lol</b>

17:16.380 --> 17:17.380
<b>#JELEE #IdolAssualtIncident</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:18.040
<b>Maimai
Nono-tan...</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:18.040
<b>#JELEE #Nonoka</b>

17:18.080 --> 17:18.540
<b>Pencil
Interested to see what this gig will be like</b>

17:18.090 --> 17:18.540
<b>#JELEE #Nono-tan</b>

17:18.580 --> 17:20.040
<b>The gig will be starting in</b>

17:25.580 --> 17:26.420
Huh?!

17:27.960 --> 17:29.080
Aren't these...?

17:31.330 --> 17:33.040
I managed to prepare it in time.

17:33.670 --> 17:34.380
Look!

17:40.250 --> 17:43.040
Huh? These images...

17:44.000 --> 17:46.170
They're all blue jellyfish?

17:46.500 --> 17:48.040
It's all fan art.

17:49.040 --> 17:51.580
They're coming from that projector on the ceiling.

17:52.130 --> 17:55.580
You know the chandelier of
illuminated bubbles where we stayed over?

17:55.880 --> 17:57.330
That's what inspired me.

17:58.000 --> 18:00.540
But there are so many.

18:00.540 --> 18:03.000
All our fans drew these, right?

18:03.130 --> 18:04.210
<b>HARUHARU@JELEE fan</b>

18:03.130 --> 18:04.210
<b>#JELEEisThisGirl</b>

18:03.580 --> 18:07.830
There's this hashtag,
and they're all drawn with the same idea.

18:04.250 --> 18:05.500
<b>Aquarium Pop</b>

18:04.250 --> 18:05.500
<b>#JELEEisThisGirl</b>

18:06.500 --> 18:07.080
<b>#JELEEisThisGirl</b>

18:08.580 --> 18:10.580
"The real face behind the character doesn't matter."

18:11.040 --> 18:16.880
"The JELEE we grew to love is this jellyfish girl. So
we're gonna believe in her."

18:18.170 --> 18:21.630
Like I said, we can still connect
with our fans without an audience!

18:22.750 --> 18:23.580
Yeah!

18:24.580 --> 18:25.580
Let's do this!

18:29.080 --> 18:35.880
I can see the lights coloring up the night

18:44.960 --> 18:54.790
"My clear colorless body goes along with the flow
Tell me, where am I?"

18:55.420 --> 19:04.210
"Twisted up in thorny words, I'm struggling to swim"

18:56.750 --> 18:58.580
<b>Her voice grosses me out
Stop trying
Don't wanna listen to some gig that got bashed
online Go away Nonoka
JELEE? Uhhh, okay lol</b>

18:56.760 --> 18:58.580
<b>Will this be archived?</b>

18:58.630 --> 18:59.830
<b>Hey! Just give it a listen!</b>

19:04.210 --> 19:14.880
"But now I'm not all alone anymore
I've accumulated each and every encounter"

19:15.000 --> 19:23.500
At the depth of the dark night, even when I was lost, what lit my way

19:23.830 --> 19:31.000
Was the many jellyfish glowing blue in the sea of a virtual world

19:31.000 --> 19:37.380
"Paint over the night, flood it completely, Obscure it outline and all"

19:37.580 --> 19:41.880
With only the blue you draw

19:41.880 --> 19:47.130
I'm here, here now to keep singing on

19:47.130 --> 19:52.250
Although I can't touch them I can definitely see them

19:52.420 --> 19:57.420
The lights coloring up the night

20:00.130 --> 20:03.670
So she got doxed?
Comments from haters? Doesn't matter.

20:03.710 --> 20:04.330
<b>Nonoka!!
You can do it JELEE
Violent Nonoka
Go away, violent idol
JELEE's the best!!!!</b>

20:03.830 --> 20:05.460
All that stupid stuff...

20:05.460 --> 20:07.460
Just drown it all out!

20:05.580 --> 20:07.420
<b>1 · Trending  #JELEE
2 · Trending  #JELEEisThisGirl</b>

20:05.590 --> 20:07.420
<b>3 · Trending  #GoLittleJELEE
4 · Trending  #Jellee
5 · Music · Trending #NoAudienceGig
6 · #MikanCrepes
7· Trending  #Halloween</b>

20:07.460 --> 20:17.630
On that night when the city lights, the glowing stars,
and all color disappeared

20:17.750 --> 20:27.960
What lit my way was the many jellyfish
glowing blue in the sea of a virtual world

20:31.210 --> 20:33.170
<b>Followers
Following
That concludes our live stream!
Thanks so much for watching!</b>

20:33.210 --> 20:36.670
<b>Thanks for coming
to our first live gig</b>

20:33.790 --> 20:35.460
That concludes the live stream.

20:41.670 --> 20:44.920
The gig... Did we reach our fans?

20:45.250 --> 20:47.210
Did we come together as one?

20:47.210 --> 20:48.080
Yeah...

20:48.460 --> 20:50.580
We... pulled through.

20:51.080 --> 20:52.750
Yup, totally.

20:56.460 --> 20:57.960
Hey, Kano.

20:58.750 --> 20:59.580
Yeah...?

21:01.380 --> 21:03.250
We made it happen, huh?

21:03.250 --> 21:04.000
Huh?

21:04.460 --> 21:05.380
See?

21:05.960 --> 21:10.460
The vision we wanted to create with our fans.
Blue glowsticks in the form of jellyfish!

21:16.920 --> 21:17.670
Yeah!

21:18.830 --> 21:22.540
All right! Then what kind of song should we make next?

21:23.380 --> 21:25.420
Nono-tan, are you sure?

21:25.750 --> 21:27.290
You deserve a bit of a break.

21:27.290 --> 21:29.920
We're doing so well. Let's keep pushing!

21:30.330 --> 21:32.790
Let's go all out, with lots of your art!

21:33.250 --> 21:36.040
Yeah, sounds great! I'll come up with lots of ideas!

21:36.460 --> 21:40.170
Okay! Let's release that as the culmination of our year.

21:40.170 --> 21:41.210
On New Year's Eve!

21:41.210 --> 21:41.920
Yeah!

21:42.290 --> 21:43.170
Then...

21:47.790 --> 21:49.880
It's a promise... okay?

