<b>Sunflower Dolls New Song Promotional Strategy
Boost recognition among a wider range of generations
by using video content that functions to agitate
with a design policy that offers unexpectedness and future potential</b>

22:16.880 --> 22:19.790
for our company's idol group, the Sunflower Dolls.

22:20.290 --> 22:22.330
My name is Yukine Hayakawa.

22:24.080 --> 22:24.830
What?

22:26.080 --> 22:29.790
Byoushin wa tomaranai ochikonderu hima wa nai

22:29.790 --> 22:38.380
Mainichi ga maninonrei da yaritaikoto darake no list

22:38.580 --> 22:45.330
Hanasu to nagaku natte shimau kara temijika ni uta de tsutaeru yo

22:45.540 --> 22:53.210
Kimi o mitsuketa ano yoru kara rhythm wa kasoku shihajimeta

22:55.580 --> 23:03.420
Ichinichi tatta no 24 jikan ja zenzen tarinainda

23:03.750 --> 23:10.420
Mada yoru ni oitsukenai noni mou asa ga kuru

23:10.540 --> 23:22.830
Ato ichijikan de iikara ano tsuki o nagamete itai kimi to onaji tsuki o

23:23.040 --> 23:29.670
Arifureta ima ni koi shitara sukoshi dake saido agatta mirai

